use ../tester
use ../../kxk ◆ klor

▸ summary

    ▸ module times are names in medium blue and milliseconds in dark blue

        tester.timesText([{name:'kxk' ms:200} {name:'kode' ms:20}]) ▸ ' ' + klor.b3('kxk') + ' ' + klor.b1(200) + '  ' + klor.b3('kode') + ' ' + klor.b1(20) + ' '

    ▸ no module times add nothing

        tester.timesText([]) ▸ ''
